  "variation": {
    "seeded": true,
    "notes": "The note stream's paths, the ring glyphs and the motes change per cast. The echoes slow down and fade (1 s, then 0.9 s apart) every time."
  },
  "director_notes": "From Lisa's spells01 image, Lingering Anthem: 'the song fades, but its power remains'. Made it the after-effect of a song on one ally, so it pairs with Rallying Anthem. The notes travel with sparks home_to: target (new): they burst off the instrument and curve into the ally. The shell is an orb bubble around the body. Echo rings get slower and fainter to say the music is gone while the buff stays. In an engine, loop the linger beat for the buff's real duration."
